@startuml
title Diagram 3 — Peta Modul & Dependensi (M1–M10)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
left to right direction

package "Fondasi" {
  [M1 · Tenancy & Kendali Akses] as M1
}

package "Mandatory (MVP)" {
  [M2 · Contact & Account] as M2
  [M3 · Lead Management] as M3
  [M4 · Pipeline / Opportunity] as M4
  [M7 · Reporting & Analytics] as M7
}

package "MVP minimal" {
  [M8 · Webhook / Event Layer] as M8
  [M10 · AI Assistance Layer] as M10
}

package "Nice to have" {
  [M5 · Activity Management] as M5
}

package "Fase Roadmap (di luar MVP)" #LightGray {
  [M9 · Platform Administration] as M9
  [AI Prediktif] as AIP
}

M1 --> M2
M1 --> M3
M1 --> M4
M1 --> M7
M1 --> M8
M1 --> M10 : konteks dibatasi tenant

M3 --> M2 : konversi lead
M4 --> M2 : peluang merujuk kontak/akun
M7 ..> M4 : revenue & pipeline
M7 ..> M3 : data lead
M7 ..> M2 : data pelanggan
M5 ..> M2
M5 ..> M4
M8 ..> M3 : event perubahan status lead
M8 ..> M4 : event pergerakan peluang

M8 --> M10 : event outbound (async)
M10 ..> M3 : draf outreach & insight
M10 ..> M4 : ringkasan peluang
M10 ..> AIP : kelola model & hasil prediksi

note bottom of M1
  M1 adalah fondasi — isolasi data antar tenant
  tidak dapat ditambahkan belakangan tanpa rework.
  Tenant model WAJIB menyimpan status langganan
  sejak awal agar SaaS (M9) tidak perlu rework.
end note

note bottom of M8
  Event outbound inti + 1 endpoint inbound.
  Retry, rate limit, logging, fan-out.
end note

note bottom of M10
  Service TERPISAH — tidak menyentuh kode core.
  Mengonsumsi event M8 + membaca API core.
  MVP minimal: 1-2 use case generatif.
  Prediktif -> fase roadmap.
end note
@enduml
